   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Investment Fund II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Social Investment Fund II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta projekt &#xe4;r en fors&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; tidigare bidrag till Moldova Social Investment Fund. Projektet bidrar med microprojekt i syfte att minska institutionaliseringen av barn. Kapacitetutveckling i nya metoder ino socialt arbete f&#xf6;r lokala politiker, social arbetare etc</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a continuation of previous donations to the Moldova Social Investment Fund. The project funds microprojects with the aim to diminish the need for institutionalization of children. Capacity building is given to local politicians, community members and social workers in new methods of social work etc</narrative>
  </description>
